.mca_resource_pane_title
  Add audio by keyword

- if selectable.does_have_keywords
  = form_with(model: [:admin, album], url: admin_album_add_audio_by_keyword_path(album, pane: :audio), local: true, class: :mca_form, method: :patch) do |f|
    .mca_form_attributes
      = render 'admin/form_fields/add_by_keyword', form: f, selectable: selectable.keywords, text_method: :title_with_audio_count
    .mca_form_actions
      = f.submit class: :mca_form_submit

- else
  .mca_form
    .mca_form_null No keywords.
